WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.975
The central nervous system, the brain and spinal cord, decides the response.

2
00:00:06.027 --> 00:00:10.052
Stimulus, receptor, command centre, effector, response.

3
00:00:13.053 --> 00:00:17.278
A reflex goes through the spinal cord: automatic and fast.

4
00:00:20.124 --> 00:00:22.774
Catching a ball: the brain decides.

5
00:00:23.502 --> 00:00:27.527
Brain and spinal cord together are the central nervous system.
